SUMMARY:Zach Rushing: The Redneck Logic Tour LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260716T055635Z
DTSTART:20260716T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nZach Rushing is a Mississippi-born comedian who has built a loyal fol
	lowing by being unapologetically himself. Known for his sharp wit\, Southe
	rn charm\, and relatable storytelling\, Zach brings a refreshing authentic
	ity to the stage that resonates with audiences across the country. \nHe ro
	se to prominence through his viral social media presence and his popular N
	ot-So-Rich-And-Famous Tour\, where he delivered honest\, hilarious takes o
	n everyday life\, pop culture\, and the Southern experience. His comedy is
	 rooted in real life — the kind of humor that makes you laugh because it h
	its a little too close to home. \nBeyond comedy\, Zach is the owner and CE
	O of Triple B Outdoors\, a brand built around his love for hunting\, fishi
	ng\, and the great outdoors. His genuine passion for the simple things in 
	life makes him a uniquely inspiring and entertaining performer in today’s 
	comedy landscape. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 16\, 2026 \nTime:
	 7:00 PM (Doors open at 5:30 PM) \nVenue: Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside M
	ain St\, Cary\, NC 27519 \nTicket Prices: $45.73 – $153.25 \nAge Restricti
	ons: This is a comedy club show — guests under 21 must be accompanied by a
	 parent or guardian. Please check with the venue for specific policies. \n
	About the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is one of the Triangle area’s premier 
	comedy destinations\, located at 1224 Parkside Main St in Cary\, NC — just
	 minutes from downtown Raleigh. Part of the nationally recognized Improv c
	omedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv has hosted some of the biggest names
	 in stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features a classic comedy club layout wit
	h tiered seating\, ensuring great sightlines from virtually every seat in 
	the house. The intimate atmosphere creates a personal connection between t
	he performer and the audience that larger arenas simply can’t replicate. \
	nThe Raleigh Improv also offers a full food and beverage menu\, so guests 
	can enjoy dinner and drinks while taking in the show. Parking is available
	 in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center. The venue is ea
	sily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests comin
	g from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat to E
	xpect\nZach Rushing’s Redneck Logic Tour promises an evening of high-energ
	y\, laugh-out-loud stand-up comedy. Expect Zach’s signature blend of South
	ern storytelling\, self-deprecating humor\, and sharp observations about l
	ife\, culture\, and the outdoors. \nThis is a solo headlining show\, so fa
	ns will get a full set from Zach himself. His performances are known for b
	eing interactive and energetic — he feeds off the crowd and delivers a sho
	w that feels personal and spontaneous every single night. \nWhether you’re
	 a longtime fan or discovering Zach Rushing for the first time\, this is a
	 night of comedy you won’t want to miss. Arrive early to grab a good seat 
	and enjoy dinner before the show kicks off. \nTicket Information\nPrice Ra
	nge: $45.73 – $153.25 \nTickets are available through official channels an
	d resale platforms. Grab your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial Ticke
	tsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commi
	ssion at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/zach-ru
	shing-the-redneck-logic-tour-live-at-raleigh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calend
	ar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/zach-rushing-the-redneck-logic-tour-li
	ve-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, Unite
	d States Of America
