DTSTAMP:20260716T055636Z
DTSTART:20260717T211500Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Andrew Dis
	mukes\nAndrew Dismukes is a rising star in stand-up comedy\, best known as
	 a cast member on Saturday Night Live. His sharp character work and absurd
	ist humor made him a fan favorite on the show\, and his live performances 
	take that energy to a whole new level. \nA Texas native\, Dismukes brings 
	a deadpan yet high-energy style to the stage\, blending clever wordplay wi
	th unexpected physical comedy. His stand-up is filled with self-deprecatin
	g storytelling and ridiculous premises built to their most hilarious concl
	usions. \nThis late show is perfect for night owls who want to cap off the
	ir Friday with a night of world-class comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Frida
	y\, July 17\, 2026 \nShow Time: 9:15 PM (Late Show) \nVenue: Punch Line Ph
	illy — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restrictions: 1
	8+ (valid ID required) \nContent Warning: Adult language and themes \nAbou
	t the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy c
	lub\, nestled in the Northern Liberties neighborhood at 33 E. Laurel Stree
	t. The intimate venue holds approximately 300 guests and is purpose-built 
	for comedy — with excellent sightlines\, top-notch acoustics\, and a livel
	y atmosphere. \nThe club features a full bar and food menu\, so you can en
	joy cocktails\, craft beers\, and bites throughout the show. The late show
	 crowd tends to be especially energetic\, making for a fantastic shared ex
	perience with fellow comedy fans. \nParking is available nearby\, and the 
	venue is easily accessible by public transit. Punch Line Philly consistent
	ly delivers world-class stand-up in an intimate setting that larger venues
	 simply can’t match. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is the late show performance b
	y Andrew Dismukes — a solo stand-up set running approximately 60–75 minute
	s. Expect the same high-energy\, laugh-packed performance as the early sho
	w\, with Dismukes known for keeping the energy electric from the first jok
	e to the last. \nDoors open approximately 30 minutes before showtime. Arri
	ve early to grab a drink and settle in. A two-drink minimum applies at mos
	t tables. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $52 – $112 (fees included) \n
	Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resa
	le). Late shows often sell out quickly — don’t miss out! \nOfficial Ticket
	sResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commis
	sion at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-d
	ismukes-live-at-punch-line-philly-late-show-july-seventeen/\n\nFrom Comedy
	 Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/andrew-dismukes-live-at-punch-line-phi
	lly-late-show-july-seventeen/
